[2.912, "o", "  Usage: pd dns <subcommand> [args] [options]\r\n  \r\n  Local DNS records for services\r\n  \r\n  Subcommands:\r\n    list                              List DNS records\r\n    register <identity> --port <n>    Register a DNS record\r\n    unregister <identity>             Remove a DNS record\r\n    lookup <hostname>                 Lookup by hostname\r\n    cleanup                           Remove stale records\r\n    status                            DNS system status\r\n    setup                             Init /etc/hosts managed section\r\n    teardown                          Remove /etc/hosts managed section\r\n    sync                              Rebuild /etc/hosts from registry\r\n  \r\n  Options:\r\n    --port <n>           Port number (required for register)\r\n    --hostname <name>    Custom hostname (must end in .local)\r\n"]
